                              "text": "唯一事实来源，12:04 保存",
                              "fontSize": "$text-micro",
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                              "lineHeight": {
                                "unit": "multiplier",
                                "value": 1.3
                              },
                              "wrap": "width",
                              "fill": "$color-ink-faint",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": "fit_content"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "cw-ws-m-title",
                              "kind": "text",
                              "text": "凌晨一点的骨汤，我蹲了三年",
                              "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                              "fontWeight": 600,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                              "lineHeight": {
                                "unit": "multiplier",
                                "value": 1.4
                              },
                              "wrap": "width",
                              "fill": "$color-ink",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": "fit_content"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "cw-ws-m-p1",
                              "kind": "text",
                              "text": "凌晨一点，夜航小馆的后厨还亮着灯。阿哲在挑今天的第二锅骨汤，勺子提起来，汤面上那层油光要刚好能挂住。",
                              "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                              "lineHeight": {
                                "unit": "multiplier",
                                "value": 1.75
                              },
                              "wrap": "width",
                              "fill": "$color-ink",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": "fit_content"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "cw-ws-m-p2",
                              "kind": "text",
                              "text": "「深夜的客人不挑味道，挑的是有没有人等。」门外刚坐下第三拨客人——代驾、下夜班的护士、抱着电脑改方案的设计师。",
                              "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                              "lineHeight": {
                                "unit": "multiplier",
                                "value": 1.75
                              },
                              "wrap": "width",
                              "fill": "$color-ink",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": "fit_content"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "cw-ws-m-p3",
                              "kind": "text",
                              "text": "这一季我们把关门时间从 23 点挪到凌晨 2 点，菜单只加了两个热菜。生意不是变多了，是变长了。",
                              "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                              "lineHeight": {
                                "unit": "multiplier",
                                "value": 1.75
                              },
                              "wrap": "width",
                              "fill": "$color-ink",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": "fit_content"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "cw-ws-m-p4",
                              "kind": "text",
                              "text": "阿哲说不用写得太漂亮，「你就写我们每天怎么等」。所以这篇里没有一个形容词是我编的。",
                              "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                              "fontWeight": 400,
                              "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                              "lineHeight": {
                                "unit": "multiplier",
                                "value": 1.75
                              },
                              "wrap": "width",
                              "fill": "$color-ink",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": "fit_content"
                            },
                            {
                              "id": "cw-ws-m-p5",
                              "kind": "text",
                              "text": "如果你也在这个点下班，路过长乐路 112 号，锅还在火上。",
                              "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                              "fontWeight": 400,
