                                    {
                                      "id": "ws-ms-p1",
                                      "kind": "text",
                                      "text": "凌晨一点，夜航小馆的后厨还亮着灯。阿哲在挑第二锅骨汤，勺子提起来，汤面上那层油光要刚好能挂住。",
                                      "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                                      "fontWeight": 400,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                                      "lineHeight": {
                                        "unit": "multiplier",
                                        "value": 1.75
