                                      "wrap": "width",
                                      "fill": "$color-ink",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": "fit_content"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "ws-ms-p2",
                                      "kind": "text",
                                      "text": "「深夜的客人不挑味道，挑的是有没有人等。」门外刚坐下第三拨客人——代驾、下夜班的护士、抱着电脑改方案的设计师。",
                                      "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                                      "fontWeight": 400,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                                      "lineHeight": {
                                        "unit": "multiplier",
                                        "value": 1.75
                                      },
                                      "wrap": "width",
                                      "fill": "$color-ink",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": "fit_content"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "ws-ms-p3",
                                      "kind": "text",
                                      "text": "这一季把关门时间从 23 点挪到凌晨 2 点，菜单只加了两个热菜。生意不是变多了，是变长了。",
                                      "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
                                      "fontWeight": 400,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-manuscript",
                                      "lineHeight": {
                                        "unit": "multiplier",
                                        "value": 1.75
                                      },
                                      "wrap": "width",
                                      "fill": "$color-ink",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": "fit_content"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "id": "ws-ms-p4",
                                      "kind": "text",
                                      "text": "阿哲说不用写得太漂亮，「你就写我们每天怎么等」。所以这篇里没有一个形容词是我编的。",
                                      "fontSize": "$text-manuscript",
